<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Paladin Spells</h1>
<p>The spells the Paladins' guild teaches, in its hall by the Midgaard Cathedral. Level is the guild level at which you can first practice the spell there, and Up to is the most you can learn it at the guild (see <a cmd='#'>Help Practice</a>). Each spell has its own help: help and the spell's name.
</p>
<pre>Name                   Level   Up to
Detect Alignment           0   50%
Detect Poison              4   50%
Detect Undead              9   50%
Cure Light Wounds         10   50%
Light                     12   50%
Repel Lesser Undead       15   50%
Sustain                   18   80%
Remove Disease            20   50%
Remove Curse              24   50%
Calm                      28   70%
Sanctuary                 30   60%
Protection From Evil      32   100%
Bless                     35   50%
Cure Serious Wounds       40   50%
Continual Light           41   50%
Dispel Evil               45   50%
Final Rest                80   100%
Raise Hitpoints           85   100%
Holy Word                 90   100%
Holy Touch               100   100%
Holy Grasp               120   100%
Holy Shout               160   100%
</pre>
